oaxaca-installer (0.1.9) stonking; urgency=medium

  * The About and Debug buttons under the installer's list of steps use the
    sidebar's text color (a branding stylesheet.qss); they had the
    application's dark text color on the dark sidebar.
  * The installer starts without the session's input method
    (QT_IM_MODULE=fcitx): with it, a dropdown's list stayed open after
    Return, so the time zone could not be chosen with the keyboard.
  * The installer starts without the session's QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME=gtk3:
    since Recommends brought qt6-gtk-platformtheme, it made the installer
    take GTK's default font, larger than its usual one.

