oaxaca-installer (0.1.8) stonking; urgency=medium

  * btrfs is the partition page's default file system (docs/7, choice 52);
    ext4 and xfs stay on offer.
  * factory-snapshot, run as shellprocess@factory after the initramfs step:
    on a btrfs root, takes the read-only @factory snapshot of @ that
    oaxaca-system-factory-reset returns the machine to, with a copy of
    a separate /boot inside it.

